# 26. JOIN

JOIN combines related data from multiple tables.

```sql
JOIN users
ON complaints.owner_id = users.id
```

Means:

```text
complaints.owner_id
        ↓
matches
        ↓
users.id
```

Example:

```text
Complaint       User
Broken road  →  dhanush
Garbage      →  mohan
```

Common joins:

```text
INNER JOIN
LEFT JOIN
RIGHT JOIN
FULL OUTER JOIN
```

